# Example
# - https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/linux,macos,windows,git
# - https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore?templates=linux,macos,windows,git

# Volume for testing
data

buildtools
dist

# Nix / local image build artifacts
result
result-*
image.tar
sbom.json
spigot.jar

# Locally-built check-outdated plugin (compiled in CI; see .github/check-outdated/)
.github/check-outdated/StopOnStart.jar
plugin-build
appdata

# Claude Code entrypoint — just points at AGENTS.md (the tracked source of truth)
CLAUDE.md

# IDE config: commit shared project settings + extension recommendations; ignore
# personal files (launch.json, tasks.json, …). The committed settings configure
# the .github/check-outdated Java analysis; full resolution needs a local
# spigot-api jar (run BuildTools or the devcontainer), otherwise it just shows an
# unresolved org.bukkit import — harmless on that CI-only helper.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
